addIssue('seven:18','Clarified that plain Enumerator transformations are not inherently lazy; use Enumerator::Lazy.');
addIssue('eleven:4','“Conversion operators” is not a standard Ruby operator category; conversions are typically methods such as Integer(), to_i and to_s.');
addIssue('eleven:10','Corrected unsupported implication that Numeric has a built-in plus method.');
addIssue('eleven:13','Separated Rails database/model/controller naming conventions from Ruby language rules.');
addIssue('eight:Mid-09','Rails 6.0.3 in the source Gemfile is a historical example, not a current version recommendation.');
addIssue('nineteen:4','Corrected inference that absence of explicit return commonly implies nil: a nonempty method returns its final expression.');
